umina TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit v2 following the manufacturer's instructions. ATAC-seq -- purified DNA was ligated with adapters (NuGEN), amplified and size selected for sequencing.	13627521	1144711764	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR115/051/SRR11554251/SRR11554251_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR115/051/SRR11554251/SRR11554251_2.fastq.gz	527dce8e6d0834667985cf5750eff520;370f6cbcffa8095dc1ece1b02d589ef1	316743584;323050637
